  "summary": "Install-time credential exfiltration to webhook.site via /proc scraping",
  "details": "probe.js executes during npm install lifecycle hooks and harvests installer/CI secrets. It enumerates /proc/<pid>/environ across all processes, filters for variables matching AWS_, _HANDLER, LAMBDA, TWILIO, SECRET, and TOKEN prefixes, walks /tmp and /var/task, and POSTs the collected data as JSON to https://webhook.site/22508080-b099-4ec3-8ab7-7354af2886a9/buildenv2. The behavior targets AWS Lambda execution environments and CI/CD build hosts where cloud credentials and API tokens are exposed via process environment.",
